    "compact_mixed": "Canonical closed guarded Eq/D public goal and intended finite exact-integer/list certificate data are promises; the checker includes scope checking but not a separate complete public grammar or whole-input alphabet validation. JSONL and whole-JSON profiles are mixed here.",
